{"format":1,"manifest":{"name":"github-day","publisher":"vyloxi","version":"1.0.0","displayName":"Hub Day","description":"A crisp, neutral light theme.","engines":{"ferrum":"^0.1.0"},"categories":["Themes"],"icon":"icon.png","repository":"https://github.com/voukengdongmofrankysteve/ferrum-market","license":"MIT","contributes":{"themes":[{"label":"Hub Day","path":"themes/github-day.json","uiTheme":"light"}]}},"files":{"icon.png":{"encoding":"base64","content":""},"themes/github-day.json":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"{\n  \"name\": \"Hub Day\",\n  \"type\": \"light\",\n  \"colors\": {\n    \"editor.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editor.foreground\": \"#24292f\",\n    \"sideBar.background\": \"#f6f8fa\",\n    \"activityBar.background\": \"#f6f8fa\",\n    \"titleBar.activeBackground\": \"#f6f8fa\",\n    \"tab.inactiveBackground\": \"#f6f8fa\",\n    \"list.hoverBackground\": \"#eaeef2\",\n    \"list.activeSelectionBackground\": \"#b6e3ff\",\n    \"input.background\": \"#ffffff\",\n    \"editorWidget.background\": \"#f6f8fa\",\n    \"panel.border\": \"#d0d7de\",\n    \"focusBorder\": \"#0969da\",\n    \"button.background\": \"#0969da\",\n    \"textLink.foreground\": \"#0969da\",\n    \"editor.selectionBackground\": \"#b6e3ff\",\n    \"editor.lineHighlightBackground\": \"#eaeef280\",\n    \"editorCursor.foreground\": \"#0969da\",\n    \"editorIndentGuide.background\": \"#d0d7de\",\n    \"errorForeground\": \"#cf222e\",\n    \"gitDecoration.addedResourceForeground\": \"#1a7f37\",\n    \"gitDecoration.modifiedResourceForeground\": \"#9a6700\",\n    \"gitDecoration.deletedResourceForeground\": \"#cf222e\"\n  },\n  \"tokenColors\": [\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"comment\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#6e7781\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"string\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0a3069\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.numeric\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0550ae\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"keyword\",\n        \"storage\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#cf222e\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.type\",\n        \"support.type\",\n        \"storage.type\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#953800\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function\",\n        \"support.function\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#8250df\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"constant.language\",\n        \"constant\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0550ae\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"variable.other.property\",\n        \"support.type.property-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0550ae\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.tag\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#116329\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.other.attribute-name\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#0550ae\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"scope\": [\n        \"entity.name.function.macro\",\n        \"meta.preprocessor\"\n      ],\n      \"settings\": {\n        \"foreground\": \"#953800\"\n      }\n    }\n  ]\n}\n"},"README.md":{"encoding":"utf8","content":"# Hub Day\n\nA crisp, neutral light theme.\n\nInstall it, then pick **Hub Day** in **Settings > Colour theme**. It is a light theme.\n\nInspired by the GitHub Primer light colors (MIT).\n\n| Role | Color |\n| --- | --- |\n| Background | `#ffffff` |\n| Text | `#24292f` |\n| Accent | `#0969da` |\n| Keywords | `#cf222e` |\n| Strings | `#0a3069` |\n| Functions | `#8250df` |\n| Types | `#953800` |\n| Comments | `#6e7781` |\n\nThis extension is only a theme: it runs no code and asks for no permissions.\n"}}}